	(text "Q1 gate: 10k series and 47 nF to the drain limit the ramp to about 20 V/ms; 470 nF to the source holds Vgs under 1.1 V on a hot plug (10 x Cgd); the Zener caps Vgs at 15 V for input transients up to the 26 V TVS clamp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
