	(text "LTC2954-2: tap PB = on, hold = off. EN# drives the P-FET gate; KILL# from GPIO10 (active low, 100 ms pulse). INT# tells GPIO1 to shut down cleanly; holding PB cuts power about 6.4 s later (1 uF on PDT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
